1. Unregistered arcanists generally must undergo collective training at correctional/educational schools established by the Foundation before proceeding with subsequent registration;
2. The St. Pavlov Foundation rates arcanists of different abilities in order to provide varying degrees of support;   
3. The St. Pavlov Foundation adopts different containment measures based on an arcanist's danger level: low-risk arcanists are not forcibly contained, whereas higher-risk ones are forcibly contained in underground containment facilities;
4. According to the "Talent Protection" regulations, certain arcanists contained by the Foundation have their outside movements restricted, especially operations related to combat.

